  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RING II Support for the Ministry of Local Government, Decentralization, and Rural Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Resilience in Northern Ghana (RING) II - Systems Strengthening activity is to strengthen service delivery systems to attain measurable improvements in the nutrition and resilience of vulnerable populations in northern Ghana, particularly reproductive-aged women and children under five years old.</narrative>
  </description>
